  scene="It is 2 a.m. at the Northwind campus. Priya, the night technician, types a question into the new assistant: \"Boiler 2 pressure is at 31 psi. What do I do?\" Behind that single line, eleven other parts of the system are about to need a language model. If each one connects to a model its own way, the first model change breaks all eleven.",
